a_browser_extension_can_ask_zkeypass = A browser extension can ask ZKeypass for logins, ask for a generated password, ask for a verification code and store a new login. Every message after the handshake is encrypted with ChaCha20-Poly1305. Pairing always needs your approval, and the service listens on this machine only.
