a_passkey_is_an_elliptic_curve = A passkey is an elliptic curve key pair kept inside the database. ZKeypass can create one, show the public part a site needs, and sign an assertion on request. Stored with the KeePassXC attribute names, so a KeePass database keeps them both ways.
